# Top-level `corpus/` holds live IQ captures: too large and too
# non-deterministic to commit. When we identify a known-good slice that
# exercises a specific decoder path, extract a minimal fixture and
# commit it under `crates/rs1090/tests/fixtures/` instead.
#
# The leading `/` anchors this to the repo root so `fuzz/corpus/` — our
# committed libFuzzer seed corpus — is unaffected.
